  "plainText": "VISION 1.0\nMARCH 2025\nwww.arkprefab.com\n\n15\nAdvantages of\nModular Buildings\n\nIn today’s construction industry,\nefficiency, flexibility, and safety are\nessential. With advanced design and\nprecision manufacturing, ARK’s modular\nbuildings provide faster, more economical,\nand safer building solutions.\n\nFast\nFlexible\n\nEconomy\nSafety\n\nQuick Deployment, Immediate Use\nAdaptable to Any Need\n\nCost-Efficient & Sustainable\nEngineered for Protection\n\nFactory-built modules reduce construction\ntime by 50%, enabling faster project\ncompletion and quicker operations.\n\nCustomizable designs suit offices, camps,\nand permanent structures, seamlessly\nadjusting to different environments.\n\nLower labor costs, reduced material waste,\nand factory-controlled quality ensure a\nhigh-value, low-maintenance solution.\n\nBuilt with high-strength steel and fire-\nresistant materials, ARK modules meet\nglobal safety standards for durability.",
